sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Vaultix App
    participant Auth as Firebase Auth
    participant DB as Firestore
    participant Crypto as PasswordCrypto

    User->>App: Open app
    alt User not authenticated
        App->>User: Show Login screen
        User->>App: Login (Email/Password or Google)
        App->>Auth: signIn request
        Auth-->>App: Auth success + UID
    else User authenticated
        App->>User: Show Master Password screen
    end

    User->>App: Enter Master Password + Unlock
    App->>DB: Read users/{uid} (salt + verifier)
    DB-->>App: user security config
    App->>Crypto: deriveMasterKey(masterPassword, salt)

    alt First unlock (no verifier yet)
        App->>Crypto: encrypt(MASTER_VERIFIER_PLAINTEXT, key)
        Crypto-->>App: verifierCipher + verifierIv
        App->>DB: Save verifier fields
        DB-->>App: Saved
    else Returning user
        App->>Crypto: decrypt(verifierCipher, verifierIv, key)
        alt Wrong master password
            Crypto-->>App: Decrypt error / mismatch
            App-->>User: Show "Master password incorrect"
        else Correct master password
            Crypto-->>App: MASTER_VERIFIER_PLAINTEXT
            App->>User: Open Home screen
        end
    end

    User->>App: Add password(site, plainPassword)
    App->>Crypto: encrypt(plainPassword, key)
    Crypto-->>App: cipherText + iv
    App->>DB: Write users/{uid}/passwords/{doc}
    DB-->>App: Write success

    User->>App: Open Home
    App->>DB: Read encrypted passwords
    DB-->>App: List of encrypted entries
    loop For each entry
        App->>Crypto: decrypt(cipherText, iv, key)
        Crypto-->>App: plainPassword
    end
    App-->>User: Render password list

    User->>App: Logout
    App->>Auth: signOut()
    App-->>User: Return to Login + clear session key
